# Secret Scanning Before Reads

Before reading any workspace file, run:

```bash
sonar analyze secrets <path/to/file>
```

If it reports a secret, do not read the file. Warn that reading would expose the credential in chat, logs, and telemetry; advise rotating it at the source and removing it. Pause the original request until removed.
